@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos

### 1. GET general (esperado 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. POST registrar alumno (esperado 201 Created)
# @name crear
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"Carlos Díaz","carrera":"Ingeniería Civil","ciclo":3,"promedio":12.0}

### 3. PUT actualizar alumno existente (esperado 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/3
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"María Rojas","carrera":"Ingeniería de Sistemas","ciclo":7,"promedio":15.0}

### 4. DELETE alumno creado en la prueba 2 (esperado 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{crear.response.body.id}}

### 5. GET id inexistente (esperado 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
